    "canonical_text": "The error to fix is the `rwlock` methods are stubs.\nunicaa01_p43_panic/main.py\n```python\n\"\"\"Thread-safe RW lock using threading.\"\"\"\nimport threading\n\nclass RWLock:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self._lock = threading.Lock()\n        self._cond = threading.Condition(self._lock)\n        self._readers = 0\n        self._writer = False\n\n    def r_acquire(self):\n        with self._lock:\n            while self._writer:\n                self._cond.wait()\n            self._readers += 1\n\n    def r_release(self):\n        with self._lock:\n            self._readers -= 1\n            if self._readers == 0:\n                self._cond.notify_all()\n\n    def w_acquire(self):\n        with self._lock:\n            while self._writer or self._readers > 0:\n                self._cond.wait()\n            self._writer = True\n\n    def w_release(self):\n        with self._lock:\n            self._writer = False\n            self._cond.notify_all()\n\ndef demo():\n    rw = RWLock()\n    rw.r_acquire()\n    rw.r_release()\n    return True\n```",
